{
  "name": "urgency-posted-at-vs-first-seen-span-rule",
  "description": "A role with no posted_at is aged by first_seen ONLY when the company's full-snapshot span is >= 45 days. 'Pine Harbor' spans exactly 45 days: its undated role (first seen 73 days ago) counts as aged, a role with a recent posted_at (a re-listed posting) wins over its old first_seen (12 days), a new role is 28 days. 'Quartz Mill' spans 44d 23:59:59 = 44: its undated role is unknown (excluded from `known`), its dated one is aged. 'Raven Press' has a single snapshot: no span, no dated roles => no_dated_roles.",
